{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d88d062d2bc16a57590c4e1506db7abe519c21c30c37824d5781fb12f32f26b0", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影が終わった。\nやよいらしい最高の笑顔がたくさん撮れたな！）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄结束了。\n拍到了许多弥生特有的、最棒的笑容呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "093be72c489c3561b57fbb363a4773fe5536cb61638d52d54e319dccd76a4ee8", "ja": "ふんふふーんふーん～～……♪\n{$P$}、お疲れさまでーっす！", "zh": "哼哼哼哼～～……♪\n{$P$}先生，辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e9a252cabd8297a5f1fe35a031cfcbc2f0576a055d3797e1c9fef5a5de3c4db4", "ja": "お疲れさま。今日はすごく調子よかったな。\n監督も、いい表情が撮れたって喜んでたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了。今天状态特别好。\n导演也很高兴，说拍到了很棒的表情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "214532d2634783dd3a340b745c6017be20544a4bb92b09a90da7968a1ee09b72", "ja": "うっうー！　それならよかったですー！\n私も、とーってもうれしくて楽しかったですから！", "zh": "呜～呜～！　那就太好啦～！\n因为我也超级开心、玩得特别尽兴呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3f1aad8ba8dd11de0d2d682a6b9e8dff63ffa03863b7b72174f7317cece15e8d", "ja": "どうしてそんなに機嫌がいいんだ？　……あ、\nそういえば今日はスーパーの特売日だったな。", "zh": "怎么心情这么好？……啊，\n说起来，今天是超市特价日来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9cd5ca25a13451ef6f4708d151de94fadbabc8559461aa23cd2fbd76d24380eb", "ja": "そうかそうか。もし、個数限定のものを\n買うとかだったら、付き合えるぞ！", "zh": "这样啊，这样啊。如果是要买限量商品之类的，我可以陪你去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "a0cc11ea1697005ee3c64bfd5356c52548169aeab554960725cd4d2b5854e7f4", "ja": "うう～……違いますよ、{$P$}！\n私だって、特売以外でうれしい日もあります！", "zh": "呜呜～……才不是呢，{$P$}！\n我也是有特价以外值得高兴的日子的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "e2aed3f925c54dab4e1bab98fb3ac024d6c1851e302ddb01ee21f516a94f4715", "ja": "……あ、限定の卵は一緒にお願いしたいですけど……\nでもでも！　今日うれしかったのはそうじゃなくて～。", "zh": "……啊，限定鸡蛋我也想请您一起买，不过……\n但是但是！今天让我高兴的不是这个～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "612d70fda51ce4ddbe1cdf2fe74260479c2915308e5d31c880d479434087ac31", "ja": "{$P$}が選んでくれた衣装、\nみんなが、すっごくほめてくれたんですー！", "zh": "{$P$}帮我选的服装，大家都夸得特别好听呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1cea8c69cd16b6cbea8ae3367fd316d4b9b9dea693082991e789e445ad7c12a8", "ja": "そうなんだ。みんなって、ファンの人たちのことか？", "zh": "这样啊。你说的大家，是指粉丝们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "656893d355ecf9c845b2d4937dab2b4da688029244bec7087c1a3bdb19f562ea", "ja": "妹や弟達です！　昨日のお夕飯の時、撮影のことを\nみんなに話したら、衣装を見たいって言われて……。", "zh": "是弟弟妹妹们！昨天吃晚饭的时候，我和大家\n说了拍摄的事，他们就说想看看服装……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "25fc7450dd6cb011f58ab77352614a93cfe75ccf5287fe7c4dcff87abf68bc4b", "ja": "それで、試着の時の写真を見せたら、\n長介たち、「お姉ちゃんカッコイイ」って！", "zh": "于是我把试穿时拍的照片给他们看，长介他们还说：“姐姐好帅气！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "4cc0be50cc3c44eccd675a3a412b64a58eca5c3a60b7a7106c109313ca47aa59", "ja": "カスミも「キレイだね」って言ってくれて、\n私、なんだかすっごくうれしくなっちゃって。", "zh": "霞也对我说“真漂亮”，\n我不知怎么的，变得特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ceeafd5fa3b5cbd1867f62f3b7b7b48893def8f12bfb02a57971e10f4855e33f", "ja": "なるほど、それであんなに機嫌がよかったんだな。\nそんなに喜んでもらえたなら、選んだ甲斐があったよ。", "zh": "原来如此，难怪你刚才那么高兴。  \n能让你这么开心，我选它也算值得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "bda0b298a5c7ab46867ac9f3ff145cd832cfc43cb1902d713e76c27e5e5e1359", "ja": "えへへ……♪\nあっ、そうだ、{$P$}！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪\n啊，对了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "6a4466ec06f76fac770e53f68fcf5ea10f964d7a6e2227b1e6b439ed02d7bf70", "ja": "このあとまだお仕事ありますか？　もし、\n{$P$}に時間があればですけど……。", "zh": "接下来还有工作吗？要是……{$P$}有时间的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "ebc02392401b25db32f1a2bf41ca1bf9d1dd2ec180440ddc381940082828b530", "ja": "帰りにスーパーでお買い物をして、\nうちで一緒にお夕飯を食べませんか？　中華ですよ！", "zh": "回去时去超市买点东西，\n要不要来我家一起吃晚饭呀？是中华料理哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ae2c0977ac6ece9da1d511c514ca8fef06a3074af400663e986aa7bea4a3dead", "ja": "えっ？　俺は大丈夫だけど……\nやよいの家はいいのか？", "zh": "诶？我倒是没问题，不过……\n去弥生家里没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "def883aad8706e4cafb12add172d0061cfc8f8cb02584d38d24bdc1081546951", "ja": "はいっ！　妹や弟達も、すっごく喜ぶと思います！\nお仕事お疲れさま会、みんなでやりたいなーって！", "zh": "好的！妹妹和弟弟们肯定也会特别开心的！\n我想和大家一起办一个慰劳工作的聚会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0193_1019_p", "source_sha256": "bb9030e5e89e5770018d68b940e90b0212cff1dcf9c6aaa7b33f3947f6fc28a7", "ja": "（その後、やよいの家で夕飯をごちそうになり……\nやよいらしい最高の笑顔を、また見ることができた）", "zh": "（之后，我在弥生家享用了晚饭……\n又一次看到了极具弥生风格的灿烂笑容）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
